      <activity id="3dfe8414-dbdd-511a-a9b0-d35513eed354" activityNameId="51e40da1-ea18-53f9-9b52-b47aa3c48a7a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Panelling, aluminium, outer door, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Panelling, aluminium, outer door, at plant
Data are based on a door leaf of 1m x 2m and scaled to 1m2 door. The frame is 0.015m wide. The aluminium sheet for panelling is 0.002m thick. 1m2 of panelling weighs 8.4kg. The material use is calculated based on the door and frame measures.;
UUID: 231d7d2b-5e2b-37ac-a144-fcc234048bf3
Included are the materials used for the panelling of the door leaf (1 side) and the door frame (1-side and interior). Transport of the materials is included. Prodction losses are not included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: The materials used were calculated based on the door measures. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_231d7d2b-5e2b-37ac-a144-fcc234048bf3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
